      "notablePrerequisites": "At least half of the basic land cards in your library are Forests.",
      "description": "Play a land.\nWhen the land enters, Springheart Nantuko triggers, causing you to pay {1}{G} to create a token copy of Avatar of Growth.\nWhen the Avatar of Growth token enters, it triggers, causing each player to search their library for up to two basic land cards and put them onto the battefield. Search for a Forest and any other basic land.\nWhen the basic lands enter, Springheart Nantuko triggers twice.\nHolding priority, activate two lands by tapping them, adding {1}{G}.\nResolve the first Springheart Nantuko trigger, choosing not to pay and creating a 1/1 Insect creature token.\nResolve the second Springheart Nantuko trigger, causing you to pay {1}{G} to create a token copy of Avatar of Growth\nRepeat from step 3 until your library contains no basic lands.",
      "notes": "You can perform this combo if fewer than half the basic lands in your library are Forests, but in that case you won't be able to find all your basic lands unless you pay an additional {G} per additional pair of non-Forest lands once you run out of Forests.",
